3577:4. **[MAJOR] [Guide:14](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/docs/RESEARCH_BOUNDARY_GUIDE.md:14), [§7:337](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/docs/RESEARCH_BOUNDARY_GUIDE.md:337), [§9:368](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/docs/RESEARCH_BOUNDARY_GUIDE.md:368).** The required sync is incomplete: Bull and GP-UCB support central body claims but are absent from §7; terms central to the rules, including `gold_probs`, `A(s)`, and Gates 4/5, are undefined in §9. Conversely, cost-aware stopping and transferred search spaces appear only in §7. The claim that §7 anchors have local PDFs is also false for several entries. **Fix:** make §7 a checked claim-to-source map and define the operative terms in §9.
3581:1. **[BLOCKER] [Guide §0:22](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/docs/RESEARCH_BOUNDARY_GUIDE.md:22), [§1.1:51](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/docs/RESEARCH_BOUNDARY_GUIDE.md:51).** The executor does **not** fit after every evaluation. Evaluation invalidates the fit; GP-dependent actions fit when needed, and RETRAIN fits without evaluating ([executor:62](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/src/opt_agent/actions/executor.py:62), [executor:99](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/src/opt_agent/actions/executor.py:99), [backend:285](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/src/opt_agent/backend/bocode_botorch.py:285)). The eight enum names themselves match [models:25](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/src/opt_agent/actions/models.py:25). **Fix:** describe the actual lazy-fit lifecycle and decide whether a new mandatory-fit behavior is intended.
3583:2. **[MAJOR] [Guide §9:392](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/docs/RESEARCH_BOUNDARY_GUIDE.md:392), [§3.4:222](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/docs/RESEARCH_BOUNDARY_GUIDE.md:222).** `U` has **six** terms, including a STOP opportunity penalty; its code default is `w_stop_opportunity=0.75` ([utility:42](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/src/opt_agent/rollout/utility.py:42), [utility:110](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/src/opt_agent/rollout/utility.py:110)). [THEORY §0:23](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/docs/THEORY.md:23) itself incorrectly says that default is zero. `gold_probs` is a softmax of valid rollout utilities, sometimes over a sampled action subset ([generator:423](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/src/opt_agent/dataset/generator.py:423)). **Fix:** reconcile the guide, THEORY, and defaults; specify the labeled action set.
3585:3. **[MAJOR] [Guide §4:245](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/docs/RESEARCH_BOUNDARY_GUIDE.md:245), [§6.2:301](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/docs/RESEARCH_BOUNDARY_GUIDE.md:301).** Records carry a hard-coded `utility_version="phase8.6b"` plus selected configuration metadata, but no schema or harness version stamp and no increment/check mechanism ([generator:548](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/src/opt_agent/dataset/generator.py:548), [decision_record:51](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/src/opt_agent/dataset/decision_record.py:51)). **Fix:** mark version freezing as a proposed contract and specify the stamp, compatibility check, and migration rule.
3587:4. **[MAJOR] [Guide §5.4:281](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/docs/RESEARCH_BOUNDARY_GUIDE.md:281).** “RLCD significantly exceeds RF” needs an arm and seed stream. On the original held-out stream, the **BT baseline** exceeds RF, while RLCD proper versus RF has a CI crossing zero ([CI artifact](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/runs/exp_rlcd_ci.json)); on the independent 100–119 replication, both contrasts are positive ([replication artifact](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/runs/exp_rlcd_loo_confirmatory_replication_s100_119.json)). Fine-tuned policies then collapse to constants in closed loop ([progress:139](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/PROGRESS_BRANCH.md:139), [progress:217](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/PROGRESS_BRANCH.md:217)). **Fix:** name the objective, arm, stream, metric, and closed-loop result.
3589:5. **[MAJOR] [Guide §6.5:329](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/docs/RESEARCH_BOUNDARY_GUIDE.md:329), [§8:359](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/docs/RESEARCH_BOUNDARY_GUIDE.md:359).** Rich-state A/B is presented as pending, but it has run: gold-argmax agreement was 0.133 in both conditions, at 2.1× tokens ([report:28](/home/lcy/Documents/projects/opt_agent_v3/runs/EXP_LENZ_JEV_REPORT.md:28)). **Fix:** report the completed negative result and retain its small-sample caveat.
