     1	"""Boundary registry sync tests — enforce RESEARCH_BOUNDARY_GUIDE.md §2.4/§6.1.
     2	
     3	The point of these tests is that the action menu CANNOT drift from its
     4	boundary classification: adding/removing/reclassifying an action without
     5	touching both the registry and the guide §2.4 table turns the suite red.
     6	
     7	Verified columns (guide §2.4 schema): ActionType | 归类 | 子菜单 | 备注 —
     8	menu membership, boundary class, and submenu are compared strictly; the
     9	备注 column is free text and is only required to be non-empty. The parser
    10	fails closed on malformed tables (bad header, short rows, duplicate or
    11	unknown action rows).
    12	"""
